oop adapters (do they have similar structure that suggests a missing abstraction OR shallow duplication?).\n\nReport back as a numbered list of distinct improvement candidates with:\n- Files involved (paths)\n- Problem (specific friction, with line numbers if possible)\n- Whether it passes the deletion test (complexity concentrates vs just moves)\n- Rough size of change (1-line fix vs. multi-file refactor)\n\nBe specific. Give me 5-10 candidates ranked by impact. Don't propose interfaces yet — just identify friction.\n\nSkip candidates that:\n- Have been recently addressed (slug unification, worker-status, loop-core split — these landed in recent commits c85b749, d6f859c, 540c9aa)\n- Are pure style/cosmetic\n- Would contradict existing CLAUDE.md rules"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4669,"cache_read_input_tokens":36228,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4669},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f32d037-1d78-4726-b16f-75668d38d257","uuid":"c3496fc9-a101-4940-a79a-b68ada099fcc","request_id":"req_011CbRLKZtU2qS2fAETjfuYA"}
