{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YQjk4qN5HibmzBUJfikM5u","type":"tool_result","content":"540c9aa CONVERGE(run-the-prompt-until-there-are-no-major-codebase-improvements-to-do): round 1\ne419178 fix(skills,cli): resolve CLAUDE.md offender paths and source dep\nd6f859c CONVERGE(the-almanac-codebase-improve-gives-no-major-improvements): round 2\nc85b749 fix(converge): overseer parser captures multi-line REASON/STEER and value-on-next-line\n6dd0b03 fix(skill): make codebase-improve model-invokable via the Skill tool\n5c7af3f CONVERGE(the-almanac-codebase-improve-gives-no-major-improvements): round 1\nefc5392 fix(converge): auto-commit stages only agent-touched paths, not the whole dirty worktree\n4526a58 CONVERGE(there-is-no-major-codebase-improvement-to-do): round 1\n1fb13a9 feat(converge): --prompt mode (agent invocation per round)\nf65247e feat(converge): wire converge into the hub launcher (menu + --new + resume)\n850a2df RALPH(converge-loop): add skill docs sync\n4d591a9 RALPH(converge-loop): add hub watch controls\ndc1d0c3 RALPH(converge-loop): add overseer goal mutation\ncad8b24 RALPH(converge-loop): add overseer verdict loop\nb3131af RALPH(converge-loop): add worker agent prompt seam\n875add9 RALPH(converge-loop): add multi-round converge budget\n1aec8f7 docs(converge-loop): PRD + 7 vertical slices for new convergence-loop primitive\n8c87161 fix: harden-loop self-improvements from harden . --loop run\n9110ae8 RALPH(converge-loop): add converge CLI skeleton\n1467073 fix(harden): bake $root/$run_id into EXIT trap at set-time","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VBXnEJr4hBEm1954BzWA3K","session_id":"7f32d037-1d78-4726-b16f-75668d38d257","uuid":"15adedc6-f2cc-4258-aa88-fad466a8b335","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:25:34.369Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Find architectural friction in almanac"}
