{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JrHPdi27LjyTU5uxp3AVMM","type":"tool_result","content":"61:If running from an installed skill path, resolve `{{SKILL_SCRIPTS}}` as in\n62:step 5 and run `bash {{SKILL_SCRIPTS}}/prompt.sh <name>`.\n203:    # or: bash {{SKILL_SCRIPTS}}/ralph.sh\n206:    bash {{SKILL_SCRIPTS}}/once.sh <name>\n209:    bash {{SKILL_SCRIPTS}}/afk.sh <name> <iterations>\n212:    bash {{SKILL_SCRIPTS}}/afk.sh auth-system 10\n215:Where `{{SKILL_SCRIPTS}}` is the absolute path to this skill's scripts. Resolve in this order:\n219:3. `${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts` — fallback if the host agent populates `CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR` from the resolved skill directory.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VBXnEJr4hBEm1954BzWA3K","session_id":"7f32d037-1d78-4726-b16f-75668d38d257","uuid":"d3c2959a-7263-4549-8935-d0acd5a052d5","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:26:01.315Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Find architectural friction in almanac"}
