{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G1ayYbtgp3XC1hmSWKQe7R","type":"tool_result","content":"30\t# ralph's between-round signal files: the afk runner watches `.ralph-stop` to halt\n31\t# and consumes `.ralph-steer` as a one-shot operator/overseer directive. Prints\n32\t# the basename; returns 1 for an unknown kind.\n33\talmanac_loop_ralph_signal_file() {\n34\t  case \"$1\" in\n35\t    stop)  printf '%s\\n' \".ralph-stop\" ;;\n36\t    steer) printf '%s\\n' \".ralph-steer\" ;;\n37\t    *) return 1 ;;\n38\t  esac\n39\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VBXnEJr4hBEm1954BzWA3K","session_id":"7f32d037-1d78-4726-b16f-75668d38d257","uuid":"70a19055-c062-4ca5-a8ae-4d155d44fb55","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:26:49.106Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Find architectural friction in almanac"}
