{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ETmuJYH4h2iQ1bBp7JMyvy","type":"tool_result","content":"40\t# Per-loop control-file path: returns the absolute path to converge's stop or\n41\t# steer file under BASE (typically the repo root, sometimes the plan dir for the\n42\t# user-facing stop helper). Routes the basename through the loop adapter\n43\t# (lib/loops/converge.sh) via almanac_loop_run_signal_file, so the `.converge-…`\n44\t# literal is owned in one place — converge-core never embeds it. Returns 1 when\n45\t# the adapter doesn't recognise the kind, matching almanac_harden_control_file.\n46\talmanac_converge_control_file() {\n47\t  local base=\"$1\"\n48\t  local kind=\"$2\"\n49\t  local name\n50\t\n51\t  name=\"$(almanac_loop_run_signal_file converge \"$kind\")\" || return 1\n52\t  printf '%s/%s\\n' \"$base\" \"$name\"\n53\t}\n54\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f32d037-1d78-4726-b16f-75668d38d257","uuid":"a550c47f-1195-4e9a-a6dc-c1c561a1236a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:32:06.080Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/converge-core.sh","content":"# Per-loop control-file path: returns the absolute path to converge's stop or\n# steer file under BASE (typically the repo root, sometimes the plan dir for the\n# user-facing stop helper). Routes the basename through the loop adapter\n# (lib/loops/converge.sh) via almanac_loop_run_signal_file, so the `.converge-…`\n# literal is owned in one place — converge-core never embeds it. Returns 1 when\n# the adapter doesn't recognise the kind, matching almanac_harden_control_file.\nalmanac_converge_control_file() {\n  local base=\"$1\"\n  local kind=\"$2\"\n  local name\n\n  name=\"$(almanac_loop_run_signal_file converge \"$kind\")\" || return 1\n  printf '%s/%s\\n' \"$base\" \"$name\"\n}\n","numLines":15,"startLine":40,"totalLines":1011}}}
